<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<main id="main">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container hero__grid">
      <div class="hero__copy reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">Free &middot; No Obligation</span>
        <h1>Free Operations Capacity Audit&trade;</h1>
        <p class="lead">Find out exactly where your SaaS or Ecommerce team is losing time to repetitive data and operational work, and how much capacity you could reclaim. It takes about 30 minutes and costs nothing.</p>
        <a href="/contact?service=capacity-audit" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Book Your Free Audit</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__media reveal" data-delay="1">
        <picture>
          <source srcset="/assets/capacity-donut.webp" type="image/webp" />
          <img src="/assets/capacity-donut.jpg" alt="Donut chart showing how team capacity is used" width="1024" height="768" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" />
        </picture>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>Who It&rsquo;s For</h2><p>SaaS and Ecommerce companies across the USA, UK, Europe and Africa whose teams spend too much time on manual data and operational work.</p></div>
      <div class="grid grid--4">
        <div class="card text-center reveal"><h3>Operations Managers</h3></div>
        <div class="card text-center reveal" data-delay="1"><h3>Delivery &amp; Customer Success Leaders</h3></div>
        <div class="card text-center reveal" data-delay="2"><h3>Marketing &amp; RevOps Leaders</h3></div>
        <div class="card text-center reveal" data-delay="3"><h3>COOs &amp; Founders</h3></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>What We&rsquo;ll Review</h2></div>
      <ul class="checklist checklist--2 reveal" style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;"><li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Current operational workflows</li><li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Data operations processes, including CRM, catalogue and reporting</li><li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Operational bottlenecks and backlog risks</li><li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Repetitive manual tasks</li><li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Quality management processes</li><li><span class="check">&#10003;</span> Resource allocation and utilisation</li></ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>What You&rsquo;ll Receive</h2></div>
      <div class="grid grid--2">
        <div class="card card--feature reveal"><h3>Workflow Assessment</h3><p>A clear review of your current processes and where unnecessary workload sits.</p></div>
        <div class="card card--feature reveal" data-delay="1"><h3>Capacity Analysis</h3><p>The tasks that can be delegated or streamlined, with an estimate of the hours you could reclaim each month.</p></div>
        <div class="card card--feature reveal"><h3>Bottleneck Report</h3><p>A short summary of the constraints affecting delivery speed and quality.</p></div>
        <div class="card card--feature reveal" data-delay="1"><h3>Recommended Support Model</h3><p>A practical, no-pressure recommendation, whether that involves Pimofy or not.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="callout-ai reveal">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">Want the Full Picture?</span>
          <h2>Add a Free AI Visibility Review</h2>
          <p>Capacity is half the growth equation. The other half is demand. Ask for an AI Visibility Review at the same time and we&rsquo;ll also show you how Google, ChatGPT, Gemini and Perplexity currently describe your brand compared with your competitors.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/ai-visibility-review" class="btn btn--primary btn--lg">Learn About the AI Visibility Review</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--soft">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><h2>How It Works</h2></div>
      <ol class="ai-steps ai-steps--3">
        <li class="ai-step reveal"><span class="ai-step__num">1</span><h3>Book a Call</h3><p>Pick a 30-minute slot in your time zone. We cover UK, EU and US business hours.</p></li>
        <li class="ai-step reveal" data-delay="1"><span class="ai-step__num">2</span><h3>We Review Together</h3><p>You walk us through your workflows. We listen and ask the right questions.</p></li>
        <li class="ai-step reveal" data-delay="2"><span class="ai-step__num">3</span><h3>You Get Your Report</h3><p>Clear, actionable findings within a few business days, covered by an NDA on request.</p></li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose-block text-center reveal">
      <h2>Investment: Free</h2>
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem;">No obligation. The goal is simply to show you where capacity is being lost and whether additional support would make a meaningful difference.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section cta-band">
    <div class="container cta-band__grid reveal">
      <div class="cta-band__text"><h2>Book Your Free Audit Now</h2><p>About 30 minutes, no pressure to commit, and useful findings either way.</p></div>
      <div class="cta-band__action cta-band__action--stack"><a href="/contact?service=capacity-audit" class="btn btn--white btn--lg">Book Your Free Capacity Audit&trade;</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
<script src="/script.js?v=<%= assetVersions.script %>" defer></script>
